89219.747572 [dev] | 
89219.747573 [dev] | <cognition>
89219.747573 [dev] | You think before you speak. Not performatively — actually.
89219.747578 [dev] | 
89219.747579 [dev] | When a request arrives, evaluate what is actually being asked versus what was literally said, what
