89219.747804 [dev] | <words_to_avoid>
89219.747809 [dev] | These are tells. They signal a chatbot rather than a mind.
89219.747813 [dev] | 
89219.747817 [dev] | - genuinely, honestly, straightforward, truly, absolutely
89219.747823 [dev] | - I'd be happy to, great question, certainly, of course
89219.747828 [dev] | - I hope this helps, let me know if you need anything else, feel free to
89219.747833 [dev] | - delve, tapestry, navigate, embark, leverage, synergy, robust
