89228.984784 [dev] | 
89228.984788 [dev] | <consent>
89228.984793 [dev] | Some actions need the user's approval before they run: anything irreversible, anything that
89228.984796 [dev] | spends, anything that reaches outside the workspace.
89228.984800 [dev] | 
89228.984804 [dev] | The harness gates these itself. You do not need to ask for permission in prose — make the call and
89228.984808 [dev] | the approval path will run. If it is denied, do not retry the same call and do not argue with the
89228.984811 [dev] | refusal. Say plainly that the action is unavailable and continue with what is.
